System sleep: reach RPM vmin in s2idle and keep the DSPs alive through it. Sleep, UFS, USB and
LPASS fixes from moWerk/sailfishos-pro1x-mainline kernel/patches-7.3 (0032-0034, 0037, 0038,
0041, 0045-0047, 0049-0051, 0053-0057), fastrpc 0034 placed by hand for 7.1.
SMP2P sleepstate, fastrpc and cpuidle-psci come from the Lenovo TB-J606L port (haltia-de).
Modem wake from mlaparie/fxtec-pro1x-guix (pro1x-qrtr-modem-wake v4): QRTR data for user space
from the ports in /sys/module/qrtr/parameters/wake_ports wakes the system, not every glink
message (moWerk's 0058-0060), which aborted each suspend on Wi-Fi and diag traffic.

