+/*
+ * The ADSP sensor framework learns from the "sleepstate" SMP2P entry whether the system is
+ * awake and wakes it through "sleepstate_see", as in the stock bengal tree
+ * (qcom,smp2p_sleepstate; driver qcom,smp2p-sleepstate). From the Lenovo TB-J606L port.
+ */
